Route14_Estuary_Indoor_House4_NPC_FloodplainRanger_Text_0:
	.string "This ranger post overlooks the open\n"
	.string "floodplain.\p"
	.string "STANTLER crosses between patches of\n"
	.string "cover. Sometimes the whole view stays\l"
	.string "still for an hour.\p"
	.string "Write down an empty watch too. If we\n"
	.string "only record exciting days, our records\l"
	.string "tell a rather different story.$"

Route14_Estuary_Indoor_House4_NPC_FloodplainObserver_Text_0:
	.string "I wanted a dramatic sighting for my\n"
	.string "notebook. So far I have wind direction,\l"
	.string "one STANTLER and a rather good drawing\l"
	.string "of my shoe.$"
